  "answer_text": "Here's some information about **\"Still in Love with You\"** by **Brooks & Dunn**:\n\n- **\"Still in Love with You\"** is the tenth track on Brooks & Dunn's album *Brand New Man*.\n\n- The song was released in **1991**.\n\n- It was written and composed by **Don Cook, Kix Brooks, and Ronnie Dunn**, and has a runtime of **3:34**.\n\nThe song is a classic country heartbreak ballad. It tells the story of someone leaving a relationship but unable to escape their feelings, no matter what. The chorus poignantly captures that theme with the line: *\"But I'd wake up still in love with you.\"*\n\nYou can find the song on streaming platforms like **Spotify**, **Deezer**, and on **YouTube**. \ud83c\udfb8\ud83e\udd20",
